              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 39,
                "start": 39
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to United States, the United States asserts that the President\u2019s two\u2011paragraph memorandum is itself binding federal law."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "United States",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "fe2d9545532c5a621c63ae9eefa8f0a501f5eeb881702098cfc64b82ecea85b3",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-fe2d9545532c-0002-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 40,
                "start": 40
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to United States, it also disputes that the treaties provide the source of the President\u2019s authority and points to the Supreme Court\u2019s decision in Sanchez\u2011Llamas as controlling."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Donovan",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "fe2d9545532c5a621c63ae9eefa8f0a501f5eeb881702098cfc64b82ecea85b3",
              "evidence_ids": [
